Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.78,0:00:07.40,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun{\3c&HE989DE&}-{\3c&HED39FC&}Brun
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:08.36,OP,,0,0,0,,噗{\3c&HE989DE&}妮{\3c&HED39FC&}露
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.36,0:00:09.86,OP,,0,0,0,,终究{\3c&HE989DE&}是{\3c&HED39FC&}玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:11.32,OP,,0,0,0,,表现出{\3c&HE989DE&}一{\3c&HED39FC&}脸遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.32,0:00:12.91,OP,,0,0,0,,IDE{\3c&HE989DE&}NT{\3c&HED39FC&}ITY
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.91,0:00:14.49,OP,,0,0,0,,全都没有{\3c&HE989DE&}啦{\3c&HED39FC&}（对对对）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.49,0:00:15.95,OP,,0,0,0,,假{\3c&HE989DE&}货真{\3c&HED39FC&}货
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.95,0:00:17.54,OP,,0,0,0,,都分{\3c&HE989DE&}不{\3c&HED39FC&}清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.54,0:00:19.08,OP,,0,0,0,,窟窿e{\3c&HE989DE&}y{\3c&HED39FC&}e eye
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:20.04,OP,,0,0,0,,快{\3c&HE989DE&}说拜{\3c&HED39FC&}拜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:23.46,OP,,0,0,0,,本能！烦恼{\3c&HE989DE&}的{\3c&HED39FC&}战斗就惨败
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:26.63,OP,,0,0,0,,Watch out！夺取别{\3c&HE989DE&}人{\3c&HED39FC&}个性的家伙决不允许
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.63,0:00:29.76,OP,,0,0,0,,那就用不一般的{\3c&HE989DE&}方{\3c&HED39FC&}式来招待  AW！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.76,0:00:33.01,OP,,0,0,0,,Perfect！将百亿满{\3c&HE989DE&}分{\3c&HED39FC&}的KAWAII送给你！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.01,0:00:35.97,OP,,0,0,0,,成为别{\3c&HE989DE&}人{\3c&HED39FC&}的理想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.97,0:00:38.81,OP,,0,0,0,,想？还{\3c&HE989DE&}是{\3c&HED39FC&}不想？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.39,0:00:45.19,OP,,0,0,0,,分离四散{\3c&HE989DE&}的{\3c&HED39FC&}细胞们呀
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.19,0:00:46.65,OP,,0,0,0,,再度集合（R{\3c&HE989DE&}ea{\3c&HED39FC&}dy GO！）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.65,0:00:48.15,OP,,0,0,0,,展{\3c&HE989DE&}露出{\3c&HED39FC&}来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.15,0:00:49.61,OP,,0,0,0,,别混{\3c&HE989DE&}入{\3c&HED39FC&}其中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.61,0:00:51.20,OP,,0,0,0,,展{\3c&HE989DE&}露出{\3c&HED39FC&}来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.20,0:00:52.70,OP,,0,0,0,,就这{\3c&HE989DE&}样{\3c&HED39FC&}伸展
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:54.24,OP,,0,0,0,,展{\3c&HE989DE&}露出{\3c&HED39FC&}来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:00:55.83,OP,,0,0,0,,超越{\3c&HE989DE&}条条{\3c&HED39FC&}框框
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.83,0:00:57.45,OP,,0,0,0,,展{\3c&HE989DE&}露出{\3c&HED39FC&}来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.45,0:00:59.21,OP,,0,0,0,,任{\3c&HE989DE&}其飞{\3c&HED39FC&}翔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.21,0:01:00.66,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun-Br{\3c&HE989DE&}un  {\3c&HED39FC&}拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:02.25,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun-Br{\3c&HE989DE&}un  {\3c&HED39FC&}给我让开
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.25,0:01:05.34,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun-Brun  {\3c&HED39FC&}不要妨碍我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:06.84,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun-Br{\3c&HE989DE&}un  {\3c&HED39FC&}奔跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.84,0:01:08.38,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun-B{\3c&HE989DE&}ru{\3c&HED39FC&}n  等下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:11.51,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun-Brun  {\3c&HE989DE&}想{\3c&HED39FC&}一直在你身边
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.51,0:01:14.64,OP,,0,0,0,,抓紧时间 {\3c&HE989DE&}去{\3c&HED39FC&}你身边…
